ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLES:4a460d8d  untestable  the utility handles its operands and data as names, numbers, keywords or opaque bytes; how bytes group into characters changes nothing the page specifies, so no observable difference can be required
ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLES:fb479014  untestable  the wording and layout of diagnostic messages are unspecified (the page says only that they should follow the locale), so no locale-dependent result can be required
ENVIRONMENT_VARIABLES:d838b9f5  impl  the format of message catalogs and the messages a utility looks up in them are implementation-defined, so a catalog search cannot be observed in a portable way
